WEBVTT

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:22.360
(Based on Mo Xiang Tong Xiu's novel
of the same name)

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:27.220
(Adult Supervision Is Recommended)

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.160
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:58.920
♪As such♪

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.800
♪I will grant your chivalry♪

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:04.960
♪As such♪

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:09.360
♪I search for you in my memories,
I yearn for you to remember♪

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:12.800
♪The green hills, the bamboo forests,
and the clouds in the sky♪

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.720
♪Everywhere♪

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:21.800
♪I regret not the time
we spent together♪

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:27.800
♪Awakening the promise never forgotten♪

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:33.480
♪A song of love and sorrow♪

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:40.400
♪A cherished love♪

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:46.040
♪Can never be parted♪

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:52.440
♪We shared wine and sorrows
underneath the moonlight♪

00:01:52.800 --> 00:02:01.840
♪I will walk with you
to the end of the world♪

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:07.840
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.400
=Episode 2=
(Frostwork)

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:29.650
We shouldn't stay here.

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:31.000
The miasma is thinner on higher grounds.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:32.340
Let's go.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:45.740
To suppress evil spirits
with demonic cultivation.

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.160
A clever method indeed.

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:48.660
It seems

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:50.480
you're familiar
with demonic cultivation as well.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:54.460
Only a little.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:56.460
But one is vulnerable to repercussions

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.650
when practicing demonic cultivation.

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.650
Even its founder, Wei Wuxian,

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:00.900
was not spared from it.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.040
I advise you not to...

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:03.740
You lunatic, you...

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.820
You... Let go of me!

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.490
Please stop messing around.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.360
If your corpse poisoning
gets any more serious,

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:20.240
even the heavenly deities
won't be able to save you.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:25.530
Why do you care?

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:36.920
Frost...

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:37.760
Jin Ling,

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:38.800
shh...

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:40.570
I told you not to touch me.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:46.550
Thank you.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.320
You've been severely infected.

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:49.780
You should concentrate your qi
and protect your heart first.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:51.500
There's no time.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:53.260
The corpses

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:54.670
(Libation)
gather to the living.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.060
But they're endless

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:57.220
and difficult to deal with.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:58.240
Oh?

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:01.410
You seem to know a lot about Yi City.

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.720
I happened to pass through here

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:04.660
on a night hunt.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:09.020
Heed my warning.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:09.880
Leave this place.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:11.590
You may be skilled,

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.300
but you have a young one with you.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:14.770
What about you?

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.400
I thought I would
get rid of as many corpses as I could

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:19.880
before I transform into one of them...

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:23.960
Hmph. Who cares how many there are?

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.030
We just have to get rid of all of them.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:25.970
Jin Ling, don't act rashly.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.530
I didn't expect you
to be so skilled in demonic cultivation.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:32.460
You think too highly of me, Taoist.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:46.170
Taoist!

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.090
There is someone controlling you.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:30.250
Rise.

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:37.250
Take him down.

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:11.400
So it was a skullpiercer, after all.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.420
It's similar to the ones
that controlled Wen Ning.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:24.410
His... His tongue was removed!

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.050
Mm.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:25.813
(Snow)

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:26.570
And...

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.740
I think I've seen him before...

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:39.200
Song Zichen?

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:41.520
Didn't he leave to search for Xiao Xingchen
and disappeared ever since?

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:43.610
Song Zichen
is a highly skilled cultivator.

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:45.610
There are only a few people
capable of killing him.

00:07:45.850 --> 00:07:46.890
Who could have done this?

00:07:50.161 --> 00:07:51.491
The mark of Frost!

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:56.450
Only Xiao Xingchen knows how to wield
the "Frost Fall Technique".

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.480
There must be a reason
why one would kill their closest friend.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:02.960
But I'm more curious

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:05.510
about the relationship between you
and the demonic cultivator

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.620
who created the skullpiercer.

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:37.800
The Ghost General!

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:39.045
Take the battle outside.

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:40.400
And don't destroy him.

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:44.350
You're impressive indeed.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:46.540
Jin Ling!

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:53.130
I guess

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:55.500
you haven't told this young man

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:56.920
who exactly you are yet, have you?

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:59.190
I'll have him sleep for a while then.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.210
How about it?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.210
Aren't I considerate?

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.610
You took down almost a hundred corpses
with a single move.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.280
To be able to unleash such power

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.370
using a low-level spell
like "Ash Summoning".

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:13.340
I've heard a lot about you,
Yiling Patriarch.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.490
You are as incredible as they say.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.340
A rascal

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:20.880
pretending to be a taoist.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:23.940
I've heard a lot about you as well,

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:25.820
Xue Yang.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:44.450
You found out.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.780
What an elegant and righteous act
you put up.

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:56.980
How interesting.

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:58.160
How fascinating.

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:00.020
If I hadn't seen the real Xiao Xingchen

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:01.860
in Chang Ping's memories,

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:04.280
I would've believed
you were him for sure.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:06.280
Not at all.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:08.440
I have a well-known friend.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.440
Now he is what you would call
a magnificent actor.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:11.840
I can't hold a candle to him.

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:15.070
So...

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:17.070
You found out about my identity

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.770
and pretended to be Xiao Xingchen
to gain my trust.

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:23.180
What exactly do you want from me?

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:27.730
I would like you to help me
with something, Senior.

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:29.320
A little favor.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:33.880
Please.

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:37.140
A spirit-trapping pouch?

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:47.550
Xue Yang,

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:49.550
you're capable of restoring
even the Stygian Tiger Amulet,

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:51.270
why would you need my help

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.060
to restore a spirit?

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.060
You're the founder.

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:56.040
Of course you're better than me.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:57.740
You can do things

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.530
I cannot.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:00.730
That's high praise.

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:03.950
But there are signs of spirit restoration
attempts all over this city.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:06.250
I'm sure you've tried many times.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:07.330
You should know

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:10.480
that a person who has suffered

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.560
so much in life

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.010
that he has no desire to live,

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.010
is almost impossible
to bring back to life.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.790
I don't know.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.190
I don't care.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.680
You must help me.

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:23.930
You can take your time considering it,

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:26.340
but I'm afraid that young man
over there doesn't have much time left.

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:29.140
Corpse poisoning is deadly.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:30.180
If you don't give him the cure soon,

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.610
he'll be done for.

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:35.460
I caught three other boys before.

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.170
If you promise to help me,

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:39.170
I won't use them as my test subjects.

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:39.900
How about it?

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:43.260
Do you often force people
to do things like this?

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:44.650
Of course.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:45.900
I'm a rascal.

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:47.900
But it takes a lot of work
to restore a spirit.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:49.670
And your offer isn't very attractive.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:52.630
You don't actually think I care
if they live or die, do you?

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.570
Then what do you want, Senior?

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:03.420
The truth...

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:06.450
behind that dismembered body
and that shattered soul.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:20.530
Hey,

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:22.350
are you really not going to consider it?

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:33.010
Lan Zhan,

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:34.210
you should've come later!

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.890
I almost got it out of him!

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:37.770
Crafty.

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:40.410
You are impressive indeed, Hanguang-jun.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.050
Even 300 corpses
aren't able to hold you back.

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:43.930
Fine.

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:46.780
You used my trick against me.

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:58.530
That little rascal sure
slipped away in a hurry.

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:00.420
That man is cunning.

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:01.880
He hasn't actually retreated.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:02.640
Mhm.

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:04.170
But there's nothing to worry.

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:05.860
Since he has something to ask of me,

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:07.140
he will show up again.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.750
Let's cure the kids first.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:11.960
Well...

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:14.450
Do you think there's glutinous rice
in a ghost city like this?

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:16.150
Glutinous rice?

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:33.710
Most of the residences
in the city are empty

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:34.830
and covered in webs.

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:36.900
Only this house is not.

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:38.580
There must be someone
taking care of this place.

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:40.840
If there are people,

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.210
there will be food.

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:44.580
It's likely they'll have glutinous rice too.

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:46.600
Come on.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:47.460
Hurry and come inside!

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.340
We're suffering from corpse poisoning.

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:51.340
But instead of looking for an antidote,
he's searching for glutinous rice.

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:52.340
Is he messing with us?

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:59.010
Be careful, Jingyi.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:00.773
(Ouyang Zizhen)

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:02.600
Why would they build such a high threshold?
To trip the ghosts and spirits?

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:04.350
You're correct.

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:11.120
This threshold

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:13.560
was specifically built
to prevent corpses from going outside.

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:16.910
Why would anyone build a threshold
to prevent corpses from going outside?

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:18.570
Wait.

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:20.850
Could it be that this place is...

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:25.690
A coffin!

00:14:32.340 --> 00:14:33.280
It's just a coffin home.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:34.680
Is it necessary to be so afraid?

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.520
Who... Who's afraid?

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.050
I've found it.

00:14:48.770 --> 00:14:50.490
There was some glutinous rice
left in the kitchen.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:00.460
What do you need

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:01.310
to put in next?

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:01.850
That.

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:06.140
And this.

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:07.260
Hanguang-jun

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.060
is different

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:10.850
from what I expected.

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:11.940
Put all of it into the pot.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.220
It's all because of that Mo Xuanyu.

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:17.220
Jingyi, mind your words.

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:33.760
Why are you guys running away?

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:36.280
Everyone gets a bowl.

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:37.140
Ah?

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:50.650
What is this?

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:51.570
Poison?

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:52.780
What do you mean, "poison"?

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:55.330
This is a special antidote
for corpse poisoning.

00:15:57.950 --> 00:15:59.420
Glutinous rice porridge.

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:01.960
Don't...

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:04.020
Given Jin Ling's spoiled temper,

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:05.870
when has he ever
suffered such a torment?

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:07.730
Stop worrying about Jin Ling.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.600
If you don't want
to join the corpse army outside,

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:12.120
you'd better finish up your porridge.

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:13.610
Finish them.

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:16.190
All right.

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:26.730
I've never had such
spicy glutinous rice porridge!

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:27.900
Water! Water!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:30.640
It's so spicy...

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:31.980
But this taste

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.880
feels familiar somehow.

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:37.720
Is it really that bad?

00:16:37.962 --> 00:16:39.042
Considering you guys are from Gusu,

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:41.330
Hanguang-jun is much better
at handling spice than you guys.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:42.970
Not at all, Senior.

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:43.940
Hanguang-jun

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:45.300
never has spicy food.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.320
Never have spicy food?

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:52.040
Is that so?

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:54.150
You lunatic! How dare you!

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:56.690
I haven't settled the matter
about Wen Ning with you yet...

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:01.620
Good.

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:02.930
You'll be cured

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.930
in about half an hour or so.

00:17:06.275 --> 00:17:07.240
You!

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:09.770
Less talk, more rest.

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:17.960
Taoist Xiao.

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:21.080
What is it?

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:22.840
Just now, that was...

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:34.290
It's the sound
of that bamboo pole again.

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.620
That thing has been following us
since we stepped foot into this city.

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.300
Nothing good happens when it sounds.

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:39.880
But Hangjun-jun was only able

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:41.410
to find us

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:43.060
because of that sound.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.810
What... What sort of demon is that?

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:50.810
We'll know

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.330
once we get a look at it.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:58.020
Hanguang-jun has spoken.

00:17:58.560 --> 00:17:59.520
So who wants to go first?

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:02.860
Young men,

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:04.180
with such cowardly attitudes,

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:05.840
how will you vanquish evil
and protect the people?

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:08.880
Who are you looking down on?

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:10.220
I'll do it!

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:18.930
It's all white...

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:20.890
There's nothing at all.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:26.380
How was it?

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:28.060
Exciting?

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:29.210
Exciting, my...

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:32.900
Yes! It was thrilling!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.500
Not bad, Sizhui.

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:47.880
You've got guts.

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:50.180
When one is frightened, their spirit
and concentration is disturbed,

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:51.560
that's when they're most vulnerable
to be attacked.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.560
Therefore,
as disciples of cultivation clans,

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:54.780
the first thing you have to do

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.820
is to build your courage.

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.370
Who are you bluffing?

00:18:58.370 --> 00:18:59.550
Ask Hanguang-jun
if you don't believe me.

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:00.690
Mm.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:02.540
How about it?

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.860
It's a rare chance
to receive my guidance.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.160
You ought to appreciate it.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:07.140
Come on.

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:09.550
Tell me what you guys saw earlier.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:13.450
White eyes.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:14.920
A girl.

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:17.800
This girl looks like a street beggar.

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.490
Her tongue was pulled out.

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:21.090
The bamboo pole in her hand

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:22.440
appears to be a cane.

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:25.120
Actually, she looks kind of pretty.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.790
If she tidies herself up,

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.460
I'm sure she'll be a beauty.

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:31.170
Not bad.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.340
You could tell she was a beauty
from just one glance.

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:35.250
You've got sharp eyes
and a unique sense.

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:37.840
I'm sure you'll be a romantic
in the future.

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:41.330
You... You tease me, Senior.

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:43.940
All right. You've observed the scene.

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:46.970
Now, let's get on to the real thing.

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:22.580
(Jing)

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:25.400
She wants us to open up this coffin.

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:27.540
I'll do it.

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:33.290
I apologize.

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:03.780
This is the real...

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:06.930
Xiao Xingchen.

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:15.770
(11 years ago)

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:29.760
Careful.

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:33.950
Miss,

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:35.250
are you all right?

00:22:00.660 --> 00:22:07.060
(Yi City)

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:20.760
♪The swallows♪

00:22:20.840 --> 00:22:21.880
♪Fly away♪

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:24.000
♪Knowing the way back♪

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:25.640
♪I strum the strings♪

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:26.840
♪And play the song♪

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:28.640
♪Wondering when you'll return♪

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:30.480
♪Who is sighing♪

00:22:30.520 --> 00:22:31.520
♪In sorrow?♪

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:33.840
♪The world is full of separation♪

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:35.280
♪When all is said and done♪

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:37.920
♪I cherish every moment we are together♪

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:40.080
♪A toast♪

00:22:40.160 --> 00:22:41.360
♪To the lush mountains♪

00:22:41.480 --> 00:22:43.120
♪We sit in a boat,
gazing up to the moon♪

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:44.880
♪A gentle mist blows♪

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:46.000
♪On the shore♪

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:48.080
♪How peaceful the world seems♪

00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:49.560
♪Who is playing the flute?♪

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:50.880
♪Separated in our previous lives♪

00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:52.720
♪I can only hope to meet you again
come next life♪

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:54.480
♪No amount of gold♪

00:22:54.560 --> 00:22:57.960
♪Would bring me
to give up these precious memories♪

00:22:59.720 --> 00:23:01.600
♪I wish never to forget those years♪

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:04.320
♪I spent searching for you♪

00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:05.840
♪Through the mountains and rivers♪

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:09.040
♪I've searched for you♪

00:23:09.560 --> 00:23:11.160
♪There you were♪

00:23:11.880 --> 00:23:13.600
♪By the dim light♪

00:23:13.840 --> 00:23:17.600
♪Although there is no wind,
my heart flutters♪

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:20.920
♪I'll overcome all the obstacles♪

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:23.360
♪To spend the rest of my life with you♪

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:25.680
♪One dressed in white,
one clad in black♪

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:28.360
♪Playing a song together♪

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:30.560
♪As we watch the sun set♪

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:32.760
♪Sharing a blissful moment♪

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:36.120
♪Away from the troubles of the world♪
